{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1000_p", "source_sha256": "409e820edee2a179077aa1d5f6d5ca19b472888ae86d570c7ed4b0c1c6d6e380", "ja": "（劇場で、タロットカードをモチーフにしたアイドル\nグッズを販売する事になった。今日はその撮影だ）", "zh": "（剧场准备要开始贩卖塔罗牌主题的\n偶像周边商品，今天则是要进行拍摄作业。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "e5593366950109d72b96b2ed3899c896154cb26e0a5011c26dc2ec631f6d76a0", "ja": "ち、遅刻してすみませーん！\n春日未来、ただいま到着しました～！", "zh": "对、对不起，我迟到了──！\n春日未来，已经抵达现场～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1002_p", "source_sha256": "fb9452501d97b85f6b7794b3d413dfbe2d12ab25b80a225b69063a625891ca94", "ja": "？　どうしたんだ、未来。\n時間にはまだ余裕あるから、遅刻じゃないぞ。", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，未来？\n还有很多时间，你没有迟到啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "321c3d534a23d863884a093d6faf0acf7bb9e579707e40fe94b1b57ee0c2b2dd", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん、大変ですよ！\n寝坊が現場しちゃって遅刻が迷惑を……え？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，大事不好了！\n我睡过头迟到，给现场工作人员添麻烦……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "577d543b51a9ba709a698b6b5db4ea475f85d909605d8c492792b729d6c5339e", "ja": "遅刻じゃないんですか？", "zh": "我没有迟到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6cacac3873bf7d44edec4affd8943e6e7bdef4a4d46c1a844daf5e96a221d7d5", "ja": "ああ。ほら、ここに時計が……\nまだ集合時間の、30分も前だ。", "zh": "对啊，这里有时钟，你看……\n距离集合时间还有30多分钟。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "569b933eff4a1a44f3dd976f43e1c31a57bee2d0c6811ac7e153016c8196b987", "ja": "ほ、ほんとだ！　ああ、よかった～。\n私、てっきり遅刻だと思ってました！", "zh": "真、真的耶！太好了，谢天谢地～\n我还以为已经迟到了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1007_p", "source_sha256": "43e5c698bb85499495028ea63a7b6dbccce34220e752dfb25d46bb1b4d41135a", "ja": "時計も見ずに、家を飛び出してきたのか。\nよっぽど慌ててたんだな。", "zh": "连时钟都来不及看就冲出家门了吗？\n看来你真的十分匆忙啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4d9d6d13214ffb061bfa473f5eb13ba895e6cc7bb50b4de49ab2c6ef83deb410", "ja": "寝坊したんだっけか。\n何か、楽しい夢でも見てたのか？", "zh": "倒是你刚刚说你睡过头？\n难道做了什么好梦吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "4d994dc46c10de992f65a1768bb8cda107b370ea189ff97a786de85a80b2d320", "ja": "そうなんです！\nなかなか、その夢から抜けられなくって……♪", "zh": "对啊！\n我一直无法从梦里醒来……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b729a285d3d40fbfa4d4a915dfe945b968d0457f8d4534b9dbb32ec684f5352", "ja": "お母さんが「未来、いつまで寝てるの？」って声を\nかけてくれなかったら、まだ寝ちゃってました……。", "zh": "要不是妈妈对我喊「未来，你要睡到几点？」，\n我现在一定还在呼呼大睡……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1011_p", "source_sha256": "4be9333a3a11e2f5661fe686b30e352fb4b6112f58d58e66314c13b1605ed06a", "ja": "はは、よっぽど楽しかったんだな。\nどんな夢だったんだ？", "zh": "哈哈，看来那个梦真的很开心呢。\n是什么样的梦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "f1e71edaf79347634cf19a99bbb67c1359c08e349eb4ac638254e1e4dfd7c371", "ja": "それが、タロットカードの夢だったんですよ～！\n世界を旅して、たくさんの人と出会って……。", "zh": "是塔罗牌的梦喔～！\n我在梦里环游世界，遇到了许多人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "1da820e90c7427126e7cbfbbcdcb42f526f2f166b882d2192530bb8ebbd77aaa", "ja": "最後はみんなで、歌ったりダンスしたり！\nすっごく、楽しかったなぁ……♪", "zh": "最后大家一起唱歌跳舞！\n真的非常地开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1014_p", "source_sha256": "05d490448a3e6b0d15cc908d14dce2ae8dfc8dbc2b5ead37e0ca44840024a0f6", "ja": "なるほど。未来らしい夢だな！", "zh": "原来如此，是场很有未来风格的梦呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "6146352cf3032d25766b17d62daa53d3101fbeb7b45b480664e86c225071ecb6", "ja": "えへへ……♪　夢の中が楽しかったから、\n今日の撮影も、きっと上手にできると思いますよ♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……♪既然做了这么开心的梦，\n我觉得今天的拍摄一定也会很顺利♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1016_p", "source_sha256": "47ec6fa655a64034c1fcfaa675e2300806cda0a263536d1e506b92c22bb0a767", "ja": "そうだな。期待してるよ！", "zh": "是啊，我很期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "e7948429db9176842429797e0890508cd9fcf21d846dc95097de48c9b2f76757", "ja": "はい！　まかせてください！", "zh": "好的！请交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0103_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0103_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ff93ca9787cba13c68ec1b50afb07a608f1d004842879161d48bec9742c60f65", "ja": "（その後の撮影は、スムーズにいった。\n『世界』のカードは、未来そのものみたいだな！）", "zh": "（之后的摄影工作进行得十分顺利。\n看来『世界』这张卡就跟未来本人没两样呢！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
